      "style": "Title",
      "text": "36 of 60 available seats were filled"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Three community classes | Snapshot: 29 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The combined occupancy was 60%. Attendance differed between the three sessions. These counts describe…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Read the counts together"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Table 1. Filled seats divided by available seats for each session. The total uses 36 ÷ 60, pooling…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What the comparison supports"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Planning had four more filled seats than Storytelling, with the same number available. That is a 20…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Keep this qualification with the finding"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A filled seat is one recorded attendance in one session. A person attending two sessions contributes…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "How this brief was made"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Method and scope"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "This example uses three fictional session records from one program. Each lists available seats and the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Source ledger"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "These records were authored for this template. They are not observations of a real program and are not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Limits on interpretation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "There is no comparison period, participant-level record or evidence about reasons for attendance. The…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The next question"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What would explain the difference in filled seats? First check registration, cancellation and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Prepared 29 September 2026 | Version 1 | Counts and units checked against the example records. No…"
    }
